<description>&lt;p&gt;El Salvador has deployed more than 2,000 troops to Haiti to locate four missing Salvadoran soldiers after a gang ambush near Port-au-Prince. Haitian gangs have intensified attacks, killing dozens of civilians and prompting UN condemnation. The Haitian government has postponed the presidential election to July 2027 amid the violence. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPSlNKcXRHam1PTFBqaExDOENsTlBKRE5lam9LZXVaVks2QlpENnlYVnZxYlZheUQyVWRLOU5LeGpRMFhxZzFxbndMYkJUWWROdUM5dU5fMzFsS3FNS0FtX2dVV0pWblNrd2pKMW80T1BYSVFUYVlqbTN6b0JHaWU4WmxBMGszUTVrOW81VWRXcDY5VUZYai0zUXhWa2cwUFZCdXlsSk5pYmdEZFZaMkUwLVo1YkRmb0R5?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQeFlCRWEyRTIzVmFfWnRHSzN3alJYM1JNNFNMOEgxVEpVaVF0aGI1dkI4czB6eDd6c0lTTUMyYnNTbFE1clZnOVptcWszNWxwb21ZYmsyazFvby00MldJcjNDbTJoUl8tanNfT2FmTHYzRFJiVHVpQ1pDUV9LTlZzUGx6RmV4d3VDMHVqRFRB?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxONE1saUhrclFYOURZbmxzcy1JVWhhV3phR0NpZ04zX0NJU0VEWDgtLWF0elBFbS1oaEo0akNGOWFtQTk2YXRVSjY0SGFRT0hTNlYxRGEtaFJjTVM3MWRyaTJYQTVXcXp6R3lNbE0tNmVIRkNyUXpUa2tEUzlyeHpLV3F2Z2U5V0JrcW9JZ2gxT1NvNldCQTB6M2tzRWtQcGVXbTVVMU13?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNaU16RlV4NUtmVGVTS0VWS0JFdkNPd0N0VmVEUU9RVGVLcHFJQ1UwZzQ0VWRKeXpXSlV3emhNM3R5NjVSZ05tNmRVOFJING5Kc25PRWhPS1ZUNGRmU01qcnhzbm9CSFJJWkFITUJjTDBaeVZvdV95VXJ1SGtDMmNfcFk0U3ByelJWSWFGQ2FZbksyZlk?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOMVRpYTJWOFVpTFFDSDhRaW